  "body": "This PR contains the following updates:\n\n| Package | Type | Update | Change | References |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| documentation | devDependencies | minor | `6.1.0` -> `6.3.3` | [source](https://renovatebot.com/gh/documentationjs/documentation) |\n\n---\n\n### Release Notes\n\n<details>\n<summary>documentationjs/documentation</summary>\n\n### [`v6.3.3`](https://renovatebot.com/gh/documentationjs/documentation/blob/master/CHANGELOG.md#&#8203;700httpsgithubcomdocumentationjsdocumentationcomparev633v700-2018-05-22)\n\n[Compare Source](https://renovatebot.com/gh/documentationjs/documentation/compare/v6.3.2...v6.3.3)\n\n##### Features\n\n-   Auto-detect readme filename ([4fd776b](https://renovatebot.com/gh/documentationjs/documentation/commit/4fd776b))\n\n##### BREAKING CHANGES\n\n-   the --readme-file option now has a smart default value\n\n#### [6.3.3](https://renovatebot.com/gh/documentationjs/documentation/compare/v6.3.2...v6.3.3) (2018-05-14)\n\n#### [6.3.2](https://renovatebot.com/gh/documentationjs/documentation/compare/v6.3.1...v6.3.2) (2018-04-24)\n\n##### Bug Fixes\n\n-   **vue:** Make vue parser tolerant of components that don't contain scripts ([#&#8203;1061](https://renovatebot.com/gh/documentationjs/documentation/issues/1061)) ([8f9bc7b](https://renovatebot.com/gh/documentationjs/documentation/commit/8f9bc7b)), closes [#&#8203;1060](https://renovatebot.com/gh/documentationjs/documentation/issues/1060)\n\n#### [6.3.1](https://renovatebot.com/gh/documentationjs/documentation/compare/v6.3.0...v6.3.1) (2018-04-23)\n\n##### Bug Fixes\n\n-   adding vue support broke tests that are not file based ([#&#8203;1058](https://renovatebot.com/gh/documentationjs/documentation/issues/1058)) ([9d7bd2e](https://renovatebot.com/gh/documentationjs/documentation/commit/9d7bd2e)), closes [#&#8203;1057](https://renovatebot.com/gh/documentationjs/documentation/issues/1057)\n\n### [`v6.3.2`](https://renovatebot.com/gh/documentationjs/documentation/blob/master/CHANGELOG.md#&#8203;633httpsgithubcomdocumentationjsdocumentationcomparev632v633-2018-05-14)\n\n[Compare Source](https://renovatebot.com/gh/documentationjs/documentation/compare/v6.3.1...v6.3.2)\n\n#### [6.3.3](https://renovatebot.com/gh/documentationjs/documentation/compare/v6.3.2...v6.3.3) (2018-05-14)\n\n### [`v6.3.1`](https://renovatebot.com/gh/documentationjs/documentation/blob/master/CHANGELOG.md#&#8203;632httpsgithubcomdocumentationjsdocumentationcomparev631v632-2018-04-24)\n\n[Compare Source](https://renovatebot.com/gh/documentationjs/documentation/compare/v6.3.0...v6.3.1)\n\n##### Bug Fixes\n\n-   **vue:** Make vue parser tolerant of components that don't contain scripts ([#&#8203;1061](https://renovatebot.com/gh/documentationjs/documentation/issues/1061)) ([8f9bc7b](https://renovatebot.com/gh/documentationjs/documentation/commit/8f9bc7b)), closes [#&#8203;1060](https://renovatebot.com/gh/documentationjs/documentation/issues/1060)\n\n### [`v6.3.0`](https://renovatebot.com/gh/documentationjs/documentation/blob/master/CHANGELOG.md#&#8203;630httpsgithubcomdocumentationjsdocumentationcomparev620v630-2018-04-20)\n\n[Compare Source](https://renovatebot.com/gh/documentationjs/documentation/compare/v6.2.0...v6.3.0)\n\n##### Bug Fixes\n\n-   **package:** update git-url-parse to version 9.0.0 ([94a1fb6](https://renovatebot.com/gh/documentationjs/documentation/commit/94a1fb6))\n\n##### Features\n\n-   Vue Support ([f60d90c](https://renovatebot.com/gh/documentationjs/documentation/commit/f60d90c))\n\n### [`v6.2.0`](https://renovatebot.com/gh/documentationjs/documentation/blob/master/CHANGELOG.md#&#8203;630httpsgithubcomdocumentationjsdocumentationcomparev620v630-2018-04-20)\n\n[Compare Source](https://renovatebot.com/gh/documentationjs/documentation/compare/v6.1.0...v6.2.0)\n\n##### Bug Fixes\n\n-   **package:** update git-url-parse to version 9.0.0 ([94a1fb6](https://renovatebot.com/gh/documentationjs/documentation/commit/94a1fb6))\n\n##### Features\n\n-   Vue Support ([f60d90c](https://renovatebot.com/gh/documentationjs/documentation/commit/f60d90c))\n\n</details>\n\n---\n\n### Renovate configuration\n\n:date: **Schedule**: \"every weekend\" in timezone Europe/Paris.\n\n:vertical_traffic_light: **Automerge**: Enabled.\n\n:recycle: **Rebasing**: Whenever PR is stale, or if you modify the PR title to begin with \"`rebase!`\".\n\n:no_bell: **Ignore**: Close this PR and you won't be reminded about this update again.\n\n---\n\nThis PR has been generated by [Renovate Bot](https://renovatebot.com/gh/marketplace/renovate). View repository job log [here](https://renovatebot.com/dashboard#algolia/instantsearch.js).",
